    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive & Well Located Four-Bedroom Detached Bungalow on 1 Acre\n\nKinsella Estates Gorey are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom detached bungalow at “Journeys End” at Mount Alexander, Gorey, Co. Wexford to the market.\n\nSet on a generous site extending to 0.41 hectares (1.01 acres), this spacious residence offers an excellent combination of comfortable family accommodation, generous outdoor space and a highly convenient location within easy reach of Gorey Town & Courtown.\n\nExtending to approximately 162.37 sq. m. (1,747 sq. ft.), the property is exceptionally well proportioned throughout. The accommodation includes a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious kitchen/dining area, utility room, two separate reception rooms, four bedrooms three of which benefit from ensuite facilities together with a family bathroom and guest W.C.\n\nThe generous kitchen/dining room forms an excellent central hub for the home, while the two separate reception rooms provide considerable flexibility for both everyday family living and entertaining. The sitting room is particularly inviting, featuring a solid-fuel stove and attractive bay window, while the second living room benefits from a feature timber fireplace.\n\nThe bedroom accommodation is equally impressive. All four bedrooms feature timber flooring and built-in wardrobes, with the master bedroom, bedroom two and bedroom four each enjoying the added benefit of their own ensuite facilities.\n\nExternally, the property is complemented by easily maintained gardens, ample parking and extensive outdoor space. The substantial circa 1-acre site further enhances the appeal of this impressive home, providing privacy and space in an attractive setting.\n\nIdeally suited to families, purchasers seeking single-storey living, or those looking for a substantial home on a generous site close to Gorey, Mount Alexander represents a superb opportunity in a highly convenient location.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended.\n\n\n BER: C1, 107159766, 160.64 kWh \n Eircode: Y25 E300\nHouse Size: (1,747 sq. ft) 162.37 sq. mt\nFolio Number: WX11713\nSite Size: 0.41 Hectares (1.01 Acre)\n\nFeatures of Property\n\n•Impressive four-bedroom detached bungalow\n•Generous site extending to 1.01 acres\n•Spacious accommodation extending to approximately 1,747 sq. ft. (162.37 sq. mt)\n•Four well-proportioned bedrooms\n•Three ensuite bedrooms\n•Two separate reception rooms\n•Spacious kitchen/dining area\n•Solid-fuel stove\n•Built-in wardrobes\n•Easily maintained gardens\n•Ample parking\n•Generous outdoor space\n•Convenient location within easy reach of Gorey\n\n\nServices:\n•Oil Fired Central Heating & back Burner off Stove\n•Sewerage - Bio Cycle\n•Mains Water\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nGround Floor:\n\nEntrance Hall: \nTimber Floor\nRecessed Lights\n\nKitchen / Dining Room: 6.5m x 3.5m\nTiled Floor & Splash Back\nDouble Doors to Side\n\nUtility Room:\nTiled Floor & Splash back\nBack Door\nW/c\nTiled\n\nLiving Room: 4.4m x 3.5m\nTimber Floor\nFeature Timber Fire Place\n\nSitting Room: 5.5m x 4.3m\nTimber Floor\nSolid Fuel Stove\nBay Window\n\nMaster Bedroom: 3.9m x 3.5m\nTimber Floor\nBuilt in Wardrobe\nEnsuite Tiled Floor & Splash Back\n\nBedroom 2: 3.7m x 3.4m\nTimber Floor\nBuilt in Wardrobe\nEnsuite Tiled Floor & Splash Back\n\nBedroom 3: 3.4m x 3.2m\nTimber Floor\nBuilt in Wardrobe\n\nBedroom 4: 3.4m x 2.6m\nTimber Floor\nBuilt in Wardrobe\nEnsuite Tiled Floor & Splash Back\n\nBathroom: 3m x 2.3m \nTiled Floor & Splash Back\nSeparate Shower Unit\n\nRear of Property \nSunny South Facing Back Garden \n\n\n"
